              <CheckBox x:Name="NativeRumbleFallback" Content="Xbox modu: tarayıcı/Claude öndeyken titreşim rumble ile devam etsin" Foreground="#EEF3FF" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                        Checked="RumbleFallback_Changed" Unchecked="RumbleFallback_Changed"/>
              <TextBlock Text="Opera, Chrome, Claude, Codex gibi uygulamalar öndeyken Windows avuçları (Sensa) engeller. Açık: o sırada rumble motorları çalar (daha kaba). Kapalı: titreşim o sırada durur, hissettiğin her şey Sensa olur. Oyunlarda etkisi yok." Style="{StaticResource Hint}"/>
              <CheckBox x:Name="RouteTriggers" Visibility="Collapsed" Checked="RouteSource_Changed" Unchecked="RouteSource_Changed"/>
              <CheckBox x:Name="RouteRumble" Visibility="Collapsed" Checked="RouteSource_Changed" Unchecked="RouteSource_Changed"/>
              <CheckBox x:Name="XboxStrictHide" Content="Deneysel · Xbox modu: kolu GameInput'tan da gizle (Game Pass / GDK oyunları)" Foreground="#FFB547" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                        Checked="XboxStrictHide_Changed" Unchecked="XboxStrictHide_Changed"/>
              <TextBlock Text="Game Pass oyunları kolu GameInput üzerinden görüyorsa sanal DualSense'i kullanmaz ve avuçlar (Sensa) oyun öndeyken susar. Açıkken oyun yalnızca sanal DualSense'i görür; kol XInput ile okunur, tetik motorları yalnızca Sensa ile sürülür. Açtıktan sonra kolu çıkarıp tak (ya da mod değiştir) ve oyunu yeniden başlat. Oyun DualSense'i desteklemiyorsa kontrol çalışmaz: o zaman kapat." Style="{StaticResource Hint}"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="RouteNativeHint" Style="{StaticResource Hint}" Margin="0,6,0,6"/>
              <Button x:Name="RouteVirtualButton" Style="{StaticResource SmallBtn}" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Click="VcBridge_Click"/>
            </StackPanel>
            </StackPanel>
            </ScrollViewer>
          </DockPanel>
        </Border>
      </Grid>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ===================== RGB (CHROMA LIGHTING) ===================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="RgbPage" Grid.Row="1" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/><ColumnDefinition Width="18"/><ColumnDefinition Width="1.15*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

      <!-- Left: Effect Selector & Brightness (Synapse / Razer Controller Setup style) -->
      <Border Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource CardBorder}">
        <DockPanel>
          <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Top" Text="Chroma RGB Aydınlatma" Style="{StaticResource CardTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Top" Style="{StaticResource Hint}" Margin="0,0,0,12"
                     Text="Wolverine V3 Pro'nun donanımsal RGB efektleri (Class 0x0F). Hem PC modunda (Doğrudan USB) hem Xbox modunda (GIP 0x0F) Synapse gerekmeden çalışır."/>

          <!-- Quick Off / On toggle & Brightness -->
          <Border DockPanel.Dock="Top" Background="#0B1222" CornerRadius="12" Padding="14,12" Margin="0,0,0,14" BorderBrush="{StaticResource Line}" BorderThickness="1">
            <StackPanel>
              <Grid Margin="0,0,0,10">
                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition/><ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                  <TextBlock Text="Aydınlatma Durumu" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="RgbPowerHint" Text="Logo ve şerit LED'leri kontrol eder" Style="{StaticResource Hint}" FontSize="11.5"/>
                </StackPanel>
                <Button x:Name="RgbQuickOffBtn" Grid.Column="1" Content="⏻  Işıkları Kapat" Style="{StaticResource SmallBtn}" Background="#4D1D24" Click="RgbQuickOff_Click"/>
              </Grid>
              <Grid>
                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/><ColumnDefinition/><ColumnDefinition Width="52"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <TextBlock Text="Parlaklık" FontWeight="SemiBold" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,12,0"/>
                <Slider x:Name="RgbBrightnessSlider" Grid.Column="1" Minimum="0" Maximum="100" Value="100" SmallChange="5" LargeChange="20" TickFrequency="5"
                        IsSnapToTickEnabled="True" VerticalAlignment="Center" ValueChanged="RgbBrightness_Changed" AutomationProperties.Name="RGB Parlaklık"/>
                <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="{Binding Value, ElementName=RgbBrightnessSlider, StringFormat='%{0:0}'}" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
              </Grid>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Top" Text="Efekt Seçimi" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,0,0,8"/>
          <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" Focusable="False">
            <UniformGrid Columns="2" Margin="0,0,4,0">
              <RadioButton x:Name="RgbEffOff" GroupName="RgbEffect" Tag="Off" Style="{StaticResource ChoiceCard}" Margin="0,0,8,8" Checked="RgbEffect_Checked">
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="⏻  Kapalı (Off)" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                  <TextBlock Text="Tüm LED'leri tamamen kapatır" Style="{StaticResource Hint}" FontSize="11.5"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="RgbEffStatic" GroupName="RgbEffect" Tag="Static" Style="{StaticResource ChoiceCard}" Margin="0,0,0,8" Checked="RgbEffect_Checked">
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="●  Sabit (Static)" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                  <TextBlock Text="Seçilen tek renkte sabit yanar" Style="{StaticResource Hint}" FontSize="11.5"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="RgbEffSpectrum" GroupName="RgbEffect" Tag="Spectrum" Style="{StaticResource ChoiceCard}" Margin="0,0,8,8" Checked="RgbEffect_Checked">
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="🌈  Spektrum Döngüsü" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                  <TextBlock Text="Tüm renkler arasında yumuşak geçiş" Style="{StaticResource Hint}" FontSize="11.5"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="RgbEffWave" GroupName="RgbEffect" Tag="Wave" Style="{StaticResource ChoiceCard}" Margin="0,0,0,8" Checked="RgbEffect_Checked">
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="〰  Dalga (Wave)" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                  <TextBlock Text="Akan gökkuşağı RGB dalgası" Style="{StaticResource Hint}" FontSize="11.5"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="RgbEffBreathing" GroupName="RgbEffect" Tag="Breathing" Style="{StaticResource ChoiceCard}" Margin="0,0,8,0" Checked="RgbEffect_Checked">
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="💨  Nefes Alma (Breathing)" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                  <TextBlock Text="1 renk, 2 renk veya rastgele nefes" Style="{StaticResource Hint}" FontSize="11.5"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </RadioButton>
            </UniformGrid>
          </ScrollViewer>
        </DockPanel>
      </Border>

      <!-- Right: Controller LED Visualizer, Color Palette & Effect Parameters -->
      <Border Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource CardBorder}">
        <DockPanel>
          <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Top" Text="Önizleme ve Özelleştirme" Style="{StaticResource CardTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Top" x:Name="RgbStatusText" Style="{StaticResource Hint}" Margin="0,0,0,12"
                     Text="Bir efekt veya renk seçtiğinde kola anında uygulanır."/>

          <!-- Controller RGB Zone Preview Banner -->
          <Border DockPanel.Dock="Top" Background="#0B1222" CornerRadius="14" Padding="18,16" Margin="0,0,0,14" BorderBrush="{StaticResource Line}" BorderThickness="1">
            <Grid>
              <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/><ColumnDefinition Width="16"/><ColumnDefinition/><ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
              <Border x:Name="RgbPreviewGlow" Width="56" Height="56" CornerRadius="28" Background="#00FF00" BorderBrush="#FFFFFF" BorderThickness="2">
                <TextBlock Text="🎮" FontSize="24" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
              </Border>
              <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                <TextBlock x:Name="RgbPreviewTitle" Text="Spektrum Döngüsü • %100" FontSize="15" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="RgbPreviewSub" Text="Bölge 0x05 (Razer Logo &amp; Şerit LED • Donanım Onaylı)" Style="{StaticResource Hint}" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
              </StackPanel>
              <Button Grid.Column="3" x:Name="RgbApplyBtn" Content="✓ Şimdi Uygula" Style="{StaticResource SmallBtn}" Background="{StaticResource Accent}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Click="RgbApply_Click"/>
            </Grid>
          </Border>

          <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" Focusable="False">
            <StackPanel>
              <!-- Sub-options for Breathing color count -->
              <StackPanel x:Name="RgbColorModePanel" Margin="0,0,0,12" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <TextBlock Text="Nefes Alma Renk Modu" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                <WrapPanel>
                  <RadioButton x:Name="RgbMode1Color" Content="Tek Renk" Tag="1" GroupName="RgbColorMode" Style="{StaticResource PresetCard}" Width="110" IsChecked="True" Checked="RgbOption_Changed"/>
                  <RadioButton x:Name="RgbMode2Color" Content="İki Renk" Tag="2" GroupName="RgbColorMode" Style="{StaticResource PresetCard}" Width="110" Checked="RgbOption_Changed"/>
                  <RadioButton x:Name="RgbModeRandom" Content="Rastgele" Tag="0" GroupName="RgbColorMode" Style="{StaticResource PresetCard}" Width="110" Checked="RgbOption_Changed"/>
                </WrapPanel>
              </StackPanel>

              <!-- Wave Direction -->
              <StackPanel x:Name="RgbDirectionPanel" Margin="0,0,0,12" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <TextBlock Text="Dalga Yönü" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                <WrapPanel>
                  <RadioButton x:Name="RgbDirLeftRight" Content="◀ Sol → Sağ ▶" Tag="1" GroupName="RgbWaveDir" Style="{StaticResource PresetCard}" Width="140" IsChecked="True" Checked="RgbOption_Changed"/>
                  <RadioButton x:Name="RgbDirRightLeft" Content="◀ Sağ → Sol ▶" Tag="2" GroupName="RgbWaveDir" Style="{StaticResource PresetCard}" Width="140" Checked="RgbOption_Changed"/>
                </WrapPanel>
              </StackPanel>

              <!-- Color Pickers & Razer Preset Swatches -->
              <StackPanel x:Name="RgbColorsPanel">
                <TextBlock Text="Hazır Razer Chroma Renkleri" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                <WrapPanel Margin="0,0,0,12">
                  <Button Content="Razer Yeşili" Tag="#00FF00" Style="{StaticResource SmallBtn}" Background="#156615" Margin="0,0,6,6" Click="RgbSwatch1_Click"/>
                  <Button Content="Siber Mavi" Tag="#00A2FF" Style="{StaticResource SmallBtn}" Background="#104E78" Margin="0,0,6,6" Click="RgbSwatch1_Click"/>
                  <Button Content="PlayStation Mavisi" Tag="#00439C" Style="{StaticResource SmallBtn}" Background="#00357A" Margin="0,0,6,6" Click="RgbSwatch1_Click"/>
                  <Button Content="Kızıl Kırmızı" Tag="#FF1E1E" Style="{StaticResource SmallBtn}" Background="#7A1515" Margin="0,0,6,6" Click="RgbSwatch1_Click"/>
                  <Button Content="Altın Sarı" Tag="#FFB800" Style="{StaticResource SmallBtn}" Background="#755500" Margin="0,0,6,6" Click="RgbSwatch1_Click"/>
                  <Button Content="Neon Mor" Tag="#A800FF" Style="{StaticResource SmallBtn}" Background="#52007A" Margin="0,0,6,6" Click="RgbSwatch1_Click"/>
                  <Button Content="Turkuaz" Tag="#00FFD5" Style="{StaticResource SmallBtn}" Background="#006B5A" Margin="0,0,6,6" Click="RgbSwatch1_Click"/>
                  <Button Content="Saf Beyaz" Tag="#FFFFFF" Style="{StaticResource SmallBtn}" Background="#4A5568" Margin="0,0,6,6" Click="RgbSwatch1_Click"/>
                </WrapPanel>

                <!-- Primary Color R/G/B Sliders -->
                <Border Background="#0F1829" CornerRadius="10" Padding="12,10" Margin="0,0,0,10" BorderBrush="{StaticResource Line}" BorderThickness="1">
                  <StackPanel>
                    <DockPanel Margin="0,0,0,6">
                      <Border x:Name="RgbColor1Swatch" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Width="26" Height="20" CornerRadius="5" Background="#00FF00" BorderBrush="#FFFFFF" BorderThickness="1"/>
                      <TextBlock x:Name="RgbColor1Label" Text="1. Renk (R / G / B)" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <Grid Margin="0,2,0,0">
                      <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="26"/><ColumnDefinition/><ColumnDefinition Width="40"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                      <TextBlock Text="R" Foreground="#FF6B6B" FontWeight="Bold" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                      <Slider x:Name="RgbR1Slider" Grid.Column="1" Minimum="0" Maximum="255" Value="0" TickFrequency="1" IsSnapToTickEnabled="True" ValueChanged="RgbSlider_Changed"/>
                      <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="{Binding Value, ElementName=RgbR1Slider, StringFormat='{}{0:0}'}" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                    </Grid>
                    <Grid Margin="0,4,0,0">
                      <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="26"/><ColumnDefinition/><ColumnDefinition Width="40"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                      <TextBlock Text="G" Foreground="#3DD68C" FontWeight="Bold" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                      <Slider x:Name="RgbG1Slider" Grid.Column="1" Minimum="0" Maximum="255" Value="255" TickFrequency="1" IsSnapToTickEnabled="True" ValueChanged="RgbSlider_Changed"/>
                      <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="{Binding Value, ElementName=RgbG1Slider, StringFormat='{}{0:0}'}" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                    </Grid>
                    <Grid Margin="0,4,0,0">
                      <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="26"/><ColumnDefinition/><ColumnDefinition Width="40"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                      <TextBlock Text="B" Foreground="#5A8CFF" FontWeight="Bold" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                      <Slider x:Name="RgbB1Slider" Grid.Column="1" Minimum="0" Maximum="255" Value="0" TickFrequency="1" IsSnapToTickEnabled="True" ValueChanged="RgbSlider_Changed"/>
                      <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="{Binding Value, ElementName=RgbB1Slider, StringFormat='{}{0:0}'}" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                    </Grid>
                  </StackPanel>
                </Border>

                <!-- Secondary Color R/G/B Sliders (for 2-color Breathing / Starlight) -->
                <Border x:Name="RgbColor2Box" Background="#0F1829" CornerRadius="10" Padding="12,10" Margin="0,0,0,10" BorderBrush="{StaticResource Line}" BorderThickness="1" Visibility="Collapsed">
                  <StackPanel>
                    <DockPanel Margin="0,0,0,6">
                      <Border x:Name="RgbColor2Swatch" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Width="26" Height="20" CornerRadius="5" Background="#00A2FF" BorderBrush="#FFFFFF" BorderThickness="1"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="2. Renk (R / G / B)" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <Grid Margin="0,2,0,0">
                      <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="26"/><ColumnDefinition/><ColumnDefinition Width="40"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                      <TextBlock Text="R" Foreground="#FF6B6B" FontWeight="Bold" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                      <Slider x:Name="RgbR2Slider" Grid.Column="1" Minimum="0" Maximum="255" Value="0" TickFrequency="1" IsSnapToTickEnabled="True" ValueChanged="RgbSlider_Changed"/>
                      <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="{Binding Value, ElementName=RgbR2Slider, StringFormat='{}{0:0}'}" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                    </Grid>
                    <Grid Margin="0,4,0,0">
                      <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="26"/><ColumnDefinition/><ColumnDefinition Width="40"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                      <TextBlock Text="G" Foreground="#3DD68C" FontWeight="Bold" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                      <Slider x:Name="RgbG2Slider" Grid.Column="1" Minimum="0" Maximum="255" Value="162" TickFrequency="1" IsSnapToTickEnabled="True" ValueChanged="RgbSlider_Changed"/>
                      <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="{Binding Value, ElementName=RgbG2Slider, StringFormat='{}{0:0}'}" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                    </Grid>
                    <Grid Margin="0,4,0,0">
                      <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="26"/><ColumnDefinition/><ColumnDefinition Width="40"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                      <TextBlock Text="B" Foreground="#5A8CFF" FontWeight="Bold" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                      <Slider x:Name="RgbB2Slider" Grid.Column="1" Minimum="0" Maximum="255" Value="255" TickFrequency="1" IsSnapToTickEnabled="True" ValueChanged="RgbSlider_Changed"/>
                      <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="{Binding Value, ElementName=RgbB2Slider, StringFormat='{}{0:0}'}" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                    </Grid>
                  </StackPanel>
                </Border>
              </StackPanel>

              <CheckBox x:Name="RgbSaveToProfileCheck" Content="Kolun dahili hafızasına da kaydet (Profil 1–4)" Foreground="#EEF3FF" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
              <TextBlock Text="İşaretliyken yaptığın aydınlatma ayarı kolun kendi EEPROM profiline de yazılır; kolu başka cihaza veya konsola taktığında aynı kalır." Style="{StaticResource Hint}" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </ScrollViewer>
        </DockPanel>
      </Border>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ===================== TUŞLAR, PROFİLLER & KISAYOLLAR ===================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="ShortcutsPage" Grid.Row="1" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="1.22*"/><ColumnDefinition Width="16"/><ColumnDefinition Width="0.96*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

      <!-- Left: Onboard Profiles (1-4), Interactive Front+Back Controller Visual, M1-M6 Remap -->
      <Border Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource CardBorder}" Padding="16,14">
        <DockPanel>
          <!-- Top: Profile Selector Bar -->
          <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Top" Margin="0,0,0,10">
            <DockPanel Margin="0,0,0,8">
              <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" x:Name="RemapStatusText" Text="Hazır" FontSize="11.5" Foreground="{StaticResource Muted}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
              <TextBlock Text="Profiller ve Arka Tuşlar (M1–M6)" Style="{StaticResource CardTitle}" Margin="0"/>
            </DockPanel>

            <Grid>
              <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/><ColumnDefinition Width="8"/><ColumnDefinition/><ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                <RadioButton x:Name="ProfileBtn1" Content="P1" Tag="1" GroupName="PadProfiles" Style="{StaticResource DeviceChip}" IsChecked="True" Checked="ProfileSlot_Checked"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="ProfileBtn2" Content="P2" Tag="2" GroupName="PadProfiles" Style="{StaticResource DeviceChip}" Checked="ProfileSlot_Checked"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="ProfileBtn3" Content="P3" Tag="3" GroupName="PadProfiles" Style="{StaticResource DeviceChip}" Checked="ProfileSlot_Checked"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="ProfileBtn4" Content="P4" Tag="4" GroupName="PadProfiles" Style="{StaticResource DeviceChip}" Checked="ProfileSlot_Checked"/>
              </StackPanel>
              <TextBox Grid.Column="2" x:Name="ProfileNameBox" Height="30" Padding="8,4" Background="#0B1222" Foreground="#EEF3FF"
                       BorderBrush="{StaticResource Line}" BorderThickness="1" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" FontSize="12.5"
                       ToolTip="Profil adını düzenle" LostFocus="ProfileName_LostFocus"/>
              <StackPanel Grid.Column="3" Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="8,0,0,0">
                <Button Content="✓ Kola Yaz" Style="{StaticResource SmallBtn}" Background="#1D4D38" Click="ProfileApplyAll_Click"
                        ToolTip="Seçili profili ve tüm M1–M6 atamalarını kola uygula"/>
                <Button Content="↺" Style="{StaticResource SmallBtn}" Margin="6,0,0,0" Click="ProfileReset_Click"
                        ToolTip="Bu profili fabrika varsayılanına döndür"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </Grid>
          </StackPanel>

          <!-- Bottom: Selected M-Button Quick Remap Controls -->
          <Border DockPanel.Dock="Bottom" Background="#0B1222" CornerRadius="10" Padding="12,10" Margin="0,10,0,0" BorderBrush="{StaticResource Line}" BorderThickness="1">
            <StackPanel>
              <DockPanel Margin="0,0,0,8">
                <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" x:Name="ControllerLiveActionText" Text="Canlı: Hazır" FontSize="11.5" Foreground="#38BDF8" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SelectedMButtonTitle" Text="Seçili: M3 (Sol Üst Arka Pedal) → Ⓐ" FontWeight="SemiBold" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#4ADE80"/>
              </DockPanel>
              <Grid>
                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/><ColumnDefinition Width="10"/><ColumnDefinition/><ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                  <RadioButton x:Name="SelM1" Content="M1" Tag="M1" GroupName="SelMButton" Style="{StaticResource DeviceChip}" Checked="MButtonSelect_Checked"/>
                  <RadioButton x:Name="SelM2" Content="M2" Tag="M2" GroupName="SelMButton" Style="{StaticResource DeviceChip}" Checked="MButtonSelect_Checked"/>
                  <RadioButton x:Name="SelM3" Content="M3" Tag="M3" GroupName="SelMButton" Style="{StaticResource DeviceChip}" IsChecked="True" Checked="MButtonSelect_Checked"/>
                  <RadioButton x:Name="SelM4" Content="M4" Tag="M4" GroupName="SelMButton" Style="{StaticResource DeviceChip}" Checked="MButtonSelect_Checked"/>
                  <RadioButton x:Name="SelM5" Content="M5" Tag="M5" GroupName="SelMButton" Style="{StaticResource DeviceChip}" Checked="MButtonSelect_Checked"/>
                  <RadioButton x:Name="SelM6" Content="M6" Tag="M6" GroupName="SelMButton" Style="{StaticResource DeviceChip}" Checked="MButtonSelect_Checked"/>
                </StackPanel>
                <ComboBox x:Name="RemapTargetCombo" Grid.Column="2" MinHeight="30" DisplayMemberPath="Label" SelectedValuePath="Target"
                          SelectionChanged="RemapTargetCombo_SelectionChanged"/>
                <Button Grid.Column="3" Content="⚡ Ata" Style="{StaticResource SmallBtn}" Background="{StaticResource Accent}" Margin="8,0,0,0"
                        Click="RemapAssignBtn_Click" ToolTip="Seçili M tuşuna bu hedefi kola hemen yaz"/>
              </Grid>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          <!-- Center: Interactive Front + Back Wolverine V3 Pro Visual Diagram -->
          <Border Background="#090F1D" CornerRadius="12" Padding="8" BorderBrush="{StaticResource Line}" BorderThickness="1">
            <Viewbox Stretch="Uniform">
              <Canvas Width="560" Height="232">
                <!-- Titles -->
                <TextBlock Canvas.Left="88" Canvas.Top="4" Text="ÖN YÜZ (Hedef / Canlı Tuş)" FontSize="11" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#7E93BC"/>
                <TextBlock Canvas.Left="362" Canvas.Top="4" Text="ARKA YÜZ (M1–M6 Atama)" FontSize="11" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#7E93BC"/>

                <!-- ===== FRONT CONTROLLER SILHOUETTE ===== -->
                <Path Data="M 54,48 C 72,38 208,38 226,48 C 246,60 258,118 250,174 C 246,204 224,218 206,208 C 190,198 182,168 164,164 L 116,164 C 98,168 90,198 74,208 C 56,218 34,204 30,174 C 22,118 34,60 54,48 Z"
                      Fill="#111C33" Stroke="#2A3E66" StrokeThickness="2"/>

